… 이럴 줄 알았으면 쉽게 동의하는 게 아니었는데!","source_cn":"没办法了……早知道之前不那么轻易答应了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62889737F831ED92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120322016:1":{"text":"…어쩔 수 없지. 얼른 거미라도 찾아보자.","source_cn":"……我们赶紧去找蜘蛛吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0BAFE86CE179877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120322017:0":{"text":"좋아! 약속을 잘 지키는 사람들이니 들어줄 거라고 생각했어!","source_cn":"好嘞！我就知道几位信守承诺的大人们一定会答应的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF4777C693E82124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120322018:1":{"text":"그럼 난 여기서 거미알을 기다리고 있을게!","source_cn":"那在下就在这里，等候各位满载而归了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7292C2245C3D2CFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"잠깐, 미어캣은 뭘 먹어? ","source_cn":"等等，你们狐獴吃什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC393DF21843CF2F3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잠깐, 미어캣은 뭘 먹어? ","female":"잠깐, 미어캣은 뭘 먹어? ","variant_male_record_index":"63390","variant_female_record_index":"63391","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"잠깐, 무슨 음식이 필요해?","source_cn":"等等，你想要带什么食物回去？","status":"matched_runti